# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Never commit your actual .env file or hardcode your API key in source files.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# Optional server port (defaults to 3000)
PORT=3000

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option 1: Free Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key (Prototyping)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Click to generate/reveal your Maps Demo Key and paste it above.
# Note: The Maps Demo Key has daily reset limits and is for prototyping only.
# When Time Zone API is unavailable on a Demo Key, the app automatically falls
# back to Places API utcOffsetMinutes to keep the destination clock working.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option 2: Production Google Cloud API Key
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Create a key at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Time Zone API.
# 3. Restrict your key following https://docs.cloud.google.com/api-keys/docs/add-restrictions-api-keys?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
